OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment recruitment freeze
OL,4,Acontinues into 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government has extended its
OL,7,Fhiring freeze to non-essential staff
OL,8,Finto 2027.
OL,10,FThe government said it would not hire
OL,11,Fany non-frontline staff across all
OL,12,Fpublic service departments to continue
OL,13,Fits commitment to reducing its
OL,14,Fworkforce.
OL,16,FIn 2024 Chief Minister Lyndon Farnham
OL,17,Fsaid the government would cut the
OL,18,Fnumber of civil servants, which had
OL,19,Fgrown by more than 2,500 between 2020
OL,20,Fand 2025, by implementing the
OL,21,Frecruitment freeze.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
