OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment recruitment freeze
OL,4,Acontinues into 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of June 2026 the government said it
OL,7,Fhad 8,945 employees - a decrease of
OL,8,F4.7% over the past year, which
OL,9,Fdemonstrated its "continued focus on
OL,10,Fprotecting essential frontline services
OL,11,Fwhile maintaining tight control over
OL,12,Frecruitment".
